Matching total transaction prices balance a commodity replacement in SEK.

========== API ==========

aggregate()

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity NEW
  format 1,000.000000 NEW
commodity OLD
  format 1,000.0000 OLD
account Assets:Shares
account Equity:Opening
2022-01-01 Opening
  Assets:Shares  1.9619 OLD
  Equity:Opening  -1.9619 OLD
2022-12-12 Replacement
  Assets:Shares  4.051281 NEW {{350 SEK}} @@ 350 SEK
  Assets:Shares  -1.9619 OLD {{350 SEK}} @@ 350 SEK

========== WARNINGS ==========

